IELTS MASTER — COMPLETE WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Build a complete, production-ready IELTS preparation platform called IELTS MASTER.

The platform must be a fully functional web application, not a static website, visual mockup, prototype, or demonstration.

It is designed for students in Kazakhstan who want to prepare for the IELTS Academic and General Training examinations.

The application must include a complete student experience, a comprehensive IELTS learning system, secure authentication, a real database, student approval workflows, a Super Admin dashboard, administrator management, progress tracking, and fully functional educational content.

The most important requirements are:
	1.	The entire website must be in English only.
	2.	The platform must contain substantial, authentic IELTS learning materials.
	3.	There must be at least 36 complete tasks for each of the four IELTS skills.
	4.	Grammar must contain at least 36 complete exercises.
	5.	Vocabulary must contain at least 500 unique English words.
	6.	The platform must include multiple complete IELTS mock examinations.
	7.	The website owner must have permanent Super Admin privileges.
	8.	Every new student registration must require Super Admin approval.
	9.	The Super Admin must have complete control over student accounts and access.
	10.	All functionality must work through a real backend and database.

Do not simplify, omit, or replace any of these requirements.

